  m_Name: ErraticeMouseMovementRespawn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: ErraticMouseMovementRespawn
  dialogueLines:
  - "That\u2019s enough spinning. The narrator has had enough. Time for a reset."
  - "The player has officially overdone it. Let\u2019s reset and try that again."
  - Enough with the camera. The narrator is stepping in. Resetting now.
  - "The player clearly isn\u2019t going to stop. Time for the narrator to intervene."
  - "That\u2019s quite enough looking around. Back to the beginning we go."
  - "The narrator\u2019s patience has run out. Let\u2019s reset the player."
  - The player has pushed the camera too far. A reset seems appropriate.
  - "Alright, that\u2019s enough. The narrator is taking control of the situation."
  - The player refuses to slow down. Fine. The narrator will reset them.
  - No more spinning. The narrator has made a decision. Time to start over.
  canRepeat: 1
  priority: 1
